  "question": {
    "text": "If the constant term in the expansion of $\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt[5]{3}}{x}+\\frac{2 x}{\\sqrt[3]{5}}\\right)^{12}, x \\neq 0$, is $\\alpha \\times 2^8 \\times \\sqrt[5]{3}$, then $25 \\alpha$ is equal to :",
